  "reason": "RNA-only scvi_n200 is currently the strongest configuration (accuracy 0.520, F1 0.498), clearly better than RNA-only PCA and much better than image-only ResNet50. The main uncertainty is whether the best RNA encoder can be improved by using multiple profiles with a simple aggregation. config_005 tests this logical extension by keeping scvi_n200 and adding multiprofile with avgpool, avoiding an unnecessary jump to transformer aggregation or multimodal fusion. It is the most informative next step because it directly evaluates whether profile aggregation helps the best known representation before testing more complex designs."
